# TR House Telvanni: promotion to Lawman (rank 3), the rank Areth Morvayn's next chore (Ra2) and the Telvanni
# patrons ask for. The rank-0 chores (Ra1, Fa1, Dr1, El1, Mi1, Va1) bring 28 reputation; Lawman needs 20, Intelligence
# and Willpower 30, and 30 and 5 in Telvanni's favored skills. The Mouths promote one rank per "Advancement" ("Yes,
# we find you worthy of %NextPCRank.", PCRaiseRank).
# The Set lines stand in for the player training Mysticism and Alteration (and Intelligence, Willpower) to the bar.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ht_va1_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ht_advance_lawman
run
player->SetMysticism 30
player->SetAlteration 30
player->SetIllusion 30
if ( player->GetIntelligence < 30 )
player->SetIntelligence 30
endif
if ( player->GetWillpower < 30 )
player->SetWillpower 30
endif
expect player->GetPCFacRep Telvanni >= 20
run
player->PositionCell 275 6977 13830 0 "Port Telvannis, Telvanni Council House: Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Areth_Morvayn"->GetDistance player < 400
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Areth_Morvayn
ask Advancement
expect player->GetPCRank Telvanni == 1
ask Advancement
expect player->GetPCRank Telvanni == 2
ask Advancement
expect player->GetPCRank Telvanni == 3
bye
end
